// TEST: Quantity Slot Default Adoption
// A defaulted param whose type carries a QUANTITY treats its default as an
// INTRODUCTION position: the API author declared the slot type right
// there, so the bare default adopts the slot's nominal (with the dims
// check ascription carries) and no BL3010 fires. Callers may omit it, or
// supply an ascribed value.
Unit meters
Unit seconds
Unit mps = meters / seconds
Unit speed: mps
function boost(v: Float<speed>, dv: Float<speed> = 1.0) -> Float<speed> = v + dv
let v0 = 4.0: speed
let b1 = boost(v0)
let b2 = boost(v0, (2.5 : speed))
// EXPECT: b1 = 5
// EXPECT: b2 = 6.5
